{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dirty Jobs Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 1090750,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/c809c60d18f30e5ecc8b5af5c6339e25.poster.avif?t=1709075958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/c809c60d18f30e5ecc8b5af5c6339e25.webm?t=1709075958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Become a dirty work specialist. Get jobs from the local townspeople and finish them on time. Go to places where no one dares to look.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/7354cdd25e65632dca00e3aec3fd8492.poster.avif?t=1709075958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/7354cdd25e65632dca00e3aec3fd8492.webm?t=1709075958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Time works against you. If you don\u2019t clean up fast enough, the risk of an epidemic in town will rise. Choose the right tools and act quickly and effectively.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/688f96bf2472bd8605bf58ddcb6c523d.poster.avif?t=1709075958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/688f96bf2472bd8605bf58ddcb6c523d.webm?t=1709075958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Do your tasks in the right order. Evaluate danger that comes with every \u2018dirty situation\u2019, make a plan and respond accordingly.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/deb679c6ad9ad8bd762268b1c8dfef04.poster.avif?t=1709075958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/deb679c6ad9ad8bd762268b1c8dfef04.webm?t=1709075958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Working with dirt and waste, you always run a risk of catching an infection. Good hygiene and a local nurse will help you to stay healthy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/9dcfb62d8ceadbe335a3c7846e36a421.poster.avif?t=1709075958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/9dcfb62d8ceadbe335a3c7846e36a421.webm?t=1709075958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>The faster you work and the more thorough you are, the more people will like you and the more they will pay you. With extra money, you can invest in better equipment, tools and cleaning products.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/c809c60d18f30e5ecc8b5af5c6339e25.poster.avif?t=1709075958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/c809c60d18f30e5ecc8b5af5c6339e25.webm?t=1709075958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Become a dirty work specialist. Get jobs from the local townspeople and finish them on time. Go to places where no one dares to look.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/7354cdd25e65632dca00e3aec3fd8492.poster.avif?t=1709075958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/7354cdd25e65632dca00e3aec3fd8492.webm?t=1709075958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Time works against you. If you don\u2019t clean up fast enough, the risk of an epidemic in town will rise. Choose the right tools and act quickly and effectively.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/688f96bf2472bd8605bf58ddcb6c523d.poster.avif?t=1709075958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/688f96bf2472bd8605bf58ddcb6c523d.webm?t=1709075958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Do your tasks in the right order. Evaluate danger that comes with every \u2018dirty situation\u2019, make a plan and respond accordingly.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/deb679c6ad9ad8bd762268b1c8dfef04.poster.avif?t=1709075958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/deb679c6ad9ad8bd762268b1c8dfef04.webm?t=1709075958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Working with dirt and waste, you always run a risk of catching an infection. Good hygiene and a local nurse will help you to stay healthy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/9dcfb62d8ceadbe335a3c7846e36a421.poster.avif?t=1709075958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090750/extras/9dcfb62d8ceadbe335a3c7846e36a421.webm?t=1709075958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>The faster you work and the more thorough you are, the more people will like you and the more they will pay you. With extra money, you can invest in better equipment, tools and cleaning products.",
    "short_description": "Be ready to get your hands really dirty. In this game you will have to do things that others find too disgusting. Sewage, excrements and blood are just a few examples of what awaits you. You need to be careful or else you will catch an infection. Staying in the hospital means the end of work.",
